# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/CBA.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title SQ-CBA Creative Brewing chain on its own (CEPortTesting), 2026-11-06 ([creative_brewing.md](../creative_brewing.md) 6, [plan_cb_publish.md](../plan_cb_publish.md) 1.2 and 14, TODO `creativebrewing/publish #3`)
@@date 2026-11-06
@@jars creativebrewing creativecommon
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_brewing.md feature_writeup/plan_cb_publish.md
@@text
@@text Not run. Needs the Creative Brewing jar with MoreJS required and the Creative Delight jar with the culture and dough
@@text block texture fix (both built 2026-11-06 late, see TODO `creativebrewing/publish #3`, `creativedelight/framework #14`),
@@text the other jars as installed in the pack 2026-11-06 01:30; copy all five into `CEPortTesting/mods/`. Supersedes SQ-CBS-01 and CQ-CBS-01. Everything runs
@@text from the CEPortTesting instance: `bash tools/scratch_query/port_chain.sh check` first (prints `MISSING` / `STALE` lines:
@@text copy the pack's jar over, game closed). Server rows use `port_chain.sh server OUT LEVEL A|B chain|instance` (a scratch
@@text dedicated server built from CEPortTesting's jars, empty `config/`, CEPortTesting's `kubejs/` plus the /zq probe; since 2026-11-16 the
@@text rows read through `/cdevtest`, so every server boot adds `ADD="creativedevtools-*.jar"`: it needs only Common and Compat), then
@@text `scratch_server.sh boot|stop OUT` and `qrun.py run` as usual. **chain** = the 14 jars Creative Brewing needs, all the way
@@text down: Rhino, Architectury, KubeJS, Create, KubeJS Create, KubeJS Delight, LootJS, MoreJS, Serene Seasons, Common, Compat,
@@text Calendar, Delight, Brewing (+ the `*_upstream` donor folders). **instance** = every non-client jar CEPortTesting has (adds
@@text Quark, Supplementaries, Fruits Delight, Hostile Delight, More Delight, Worldgen, ...). Boots, one JVM at a time:
@@text (1) chain, group A, fresh: CBA-01 to -10; (2) same OUT, `[members] vinery = false`: CBA-11; (3) same OUT, vinery back on,
@@text `brewinandchewin = false`: CBA-12; (4) new OUT, `NOUPSTREAM=vinery_upstream`: CBA-13; (5) new OUT,
@@text `DROP="kubejsdelight-*.jar SereneSeasons-*.jar morejs-forge-*.jar"`: CBA-14; (6) new OUT, instance, group B: CBA-15 to -18. Client rows run
@@text in CEPortTesting itself through ATLauncher: `port_chain.sh bare` parks every non-chain jar in
@@text `disabledmods/cba_parked/` (game closed), `port_chain.sh restore` puts them back; a new creative superflat world each.
@@text Superflat surface: blocks at y -61, air from -60; spawn chunks around 0 0 stay loaded.
@@text
@@table
