## CQ-CBA-01
@group client
@commands `port_chain.sh bare`; launch CEPortTesting (ATLauncher); new creative superflat world; Mods screen; `/give @s creativebrewing:potion_bucket{Potion:"minecraft:swiftness"}`, same for `splash_potion_bucket` and `lingering_potion_bucket`; `/effect give @s creativecommon:magic_resistance 60`; place a beef culture block and a cookie dough block; `grep -E "Using missing texture.*(creativebrewing\|vinery\|brewinandchewin\|foundation\|_culture_block\|dough_block)" logs/latest.log`
@pass "Creative Brewing", "Vinery (Creative Brewing)", "Brewin' & Chewin' (Creative Brewing)", "Foundation (Creative Brewing)" listed; the three buckets show the bucket with the potion's tint; Magic Resistance shows its own HUD and inventory icon; the culture and dough blocks show their own textures in hand and placed; the grep prints nothing (Vinery's 14 `#missing` wine-box warnings are also in the full pack, not counted)
@fails M3 assets not in the CB jar (`unzip -l`), or KubeJS client textures `assets/creativebrewing/kubejs/creativebrewing/potion_buckets.js`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# setup: port_chain.sh bare; launch CEPortTesting through run_captures.py serve (creative superflat)
> give @s creativebrewing:potion_bucket{Potion:"minecraft:swiftness"}
> give @s creativebrewing:splash_potion_bucket{Potion:"minecraft:swiftness"}
> give @s creativebrewing:lingering_potion_bucket{Potion:"minecraft:swiftness"}
> effect give @s creativecommon:magic_resistance 60
> setblock 0 101 3 creativedelight:beef_culture_block
> setblock 2 101 3 creativedelight:cookie_dough_block
do {"effects": true, "expect": "creativecommon:magic_resistance"}
do {"screen": "inventory"}
shot inventory
do {"screen": "close"}
do {"look": {"from": "1 103 0", "at": "1 101 3"}}
do {"wait": "chunks"}
shot blocks
do {"press": "escape"}
do {"click_widget": "Mods"}
do {"type_into": {"class": "EditBox", "n": 0}, "text": "Creative Brewing"}
shot mods_screen
do {"press": "escape"}
do {"press": "escape"}
shell grep -E "Using missing texture.*(creativebrewing|vinery|brewinandchewin|foundation|_culture_block|dough_block)" logs/latest.log | grep -v "#missing" | head -5; true
look buckets tinted (inventory shot), Magic Resistance has its own icon (HUD and inventory), culture and dough blocks textured; the mods shot lists Creative Brewing, Vinery (Creative Brewing), Brewin' & Chewin' (Creative Brewing), Foundation (Creative Brewing); the grep prints nothing beyond Vinery's 14 wine-box warnings
